---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — CryptoNav"
  description="How CryptoNav handles your data: what we log, what we store in cookies, the third-party services we use, and how to ask us to delete your data."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy' }]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-surface-400 mb-8">Last updated: August 27, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6">
      <p class="text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        CryptoNav ("we", "us", or "our") operates this website at cryptonav.site. This page explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have. By using the site, you agree to the practices described here.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        CryptoNav is a static information-navigation site and does not require you to create an account. We collect only:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
        <li><strong>Aggregated, anonymous usage data</strong> via privacy-respecting analytics (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics), which may record page views, referrers, and approximate region. This data cannot identify you personally.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> (measurement ID <code class="text-xs">G-MD66BHJN9Y</code>), which records page views, approximate location derived from your IP address, device and browser type, and a randomly generated client identifier stored in a cookie. Unlike Cloudflare Web Analytics, that identifier persists between visits and is processed by Google on our behalf.</li>
        <li><strong>Information you send us voluntarily</strong> when you email us (for example, a project submission or partnership inquiry). This includes only what you choose to share.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">2. Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        We use a small number of first-party cookies. One remembers your light/dark theme preference. Google Analytics 4 sets cookies named <code class="text-xs">_ga</code> and <code class="text-xs">_ga_*</code>, which hold a randomly generated identifier so that repeat visits can be attributed to the same browser.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        These are analytics cookies, not advertising cookies: we do not run ad retargeting, and we do not sell or share this data with anyone other than Google acting as our analytics processor. You can block or delete them at any time in your browser settings — the site works fine without them — or install Google's <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener nofollow" class="text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-400 underline">Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">3. Third-Party Links & Affiliates</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        CryptoNav lists third-party exchanges, wallets, and services. Some of these listings may be affiliate links, meaning we may earn a commission if you sign up or make a purchase — at no extra cost to you. Once you leave cryptonav.site, you are subject to the privacy policies of those third parties, which we encourage you to review.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">4. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        This site is not directed to individuals under 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">5. Data Security</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        We apply reasonable measures to protect the limited information we handle. Because the site collects almost no personal data, your exposure is minimal.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by the "Last updated" date above.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">7. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:contact@cryptonav.site" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">contact@cryptonav.site</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
